783][1028,850]" /><node index="8" text="אָמַרְתְּ לַה' אֲדֹ-נָי אָתָּה טוֹבָתִי בַּל־עָלֶיךָ׃" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[52,871][1028,938]" /><node index="9" text="לִקְדוֹשִׁים אֲשֶׁר־בָּאָרֶץ הֵמָּה וְאַדִּירֵי כָּל־חֶפְצִי־בָם׃" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[52,959][1028,1026]" /><node index="10" text="יִרְבּוּ עַצְּבוֹתָם אַחֵר מָהָרוּ בַּל־אַסִּיךְ נִסְכֵּיהֶם מִדָּם וּבַל־אֶשָּׂא אֶת־שְׁמוֹתָם עַל־שְׂפָתָי׃" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[52,1047][1028,1195]" /><node index="11" text="ה' מְנָת־חֶלְקִי וְכוֹסִי אַתָּה תּוֹמִיךְ גּוֹרָלִי׃" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[52,1216][1028,1283]" /><node index="12" text="חֲבָלִים נָפְלוּ־לִי בַּנְּעִמִים אַף־נַחֲלָת שָׁפְרָה עָלָי׃" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.myhitbodedut" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[52,1304][1028,1371]" /><node index="13" text="אֲב